---
title: Pancakes
portions: 2
category: Breakfast
---

## Batter ->&batter

In a #medium bowl{}, whisk the @flour{160 g}, the @baking powder{1 tsp}, the @sugar{1 tbsp} and the @salt{1/4 tsp}. ->&dry mix{}

To the &dry mix{}, add the @buttermilk{1 cup}, the @egg{1} and the @vanilla extract{1/2 tsp}.

## Cooking

Pour the &batter onto a #baking sheet{} at ^{medium heat} and cook for ~{2 min}.
